     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>CheckpointerShutdown</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待检查点进程被终止。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>IoWorkerMain</literal></entry>
      <entry>在 IO 工作进程的主循环中等待。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>LogicalApplyMain</literal></entry>
      <entry>在逻辑复制应用进程的主循环中等待。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>LogicalLauncherMain</literal></entry>
      <entry>在逻辑复制启动器进程的主循环中等待。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>LogicalParallelApplyMain</literal></entry>
      <entry>在逻辑复制并行应用进程的主循环中等待。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>RecoveryWalStream</literal></entry>
      <entry>在流式恢复期间，启动进程的主循环中等待 WAL 到达。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ReplicationSlotsyncMain</literal></entry>
      <entry>在槽同步工作进程的主循环中等待。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ReplicationSlotsyncShutdown</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待槽同步工作进程关闭。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>SysloggerMain</literal></entry>
      <entry>在 syslogger 进程的主循环中等待。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>WalReceiverMain</literal></entry>
      <entry>在 WAL 接收进程的主循环中等待。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>WalSenderMain</literal></entry>
      <entry>正在 WAL 发送进程的主循环中等待。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>WalSummarizerWal</literal></entry>
      <entry>正在 WAL 汇总器中等待生成更多 WAL。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>WalWriterMain</literal></entry>
      <entry>正在 WAL 写入进程的主循环中等待。</entry>
     </row>
    </tbody>
   </tgroup>
  </table>

