  <table id="wait-event-ipc-table">
   <title><literal>Ipc</literal> 类型的等待事件。</title>
   <tgroup cols="2">
    <thead>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>IPC</literal> Wait Event</entry>
      <entry>描述</entry>
     </row>
    </thead>

    <tbody>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>AppendReady</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待 <literal>Append</literal> 计划节点的子计划节点就绪。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ArchiveCleanupCommand</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待 <xref linkend="guc-archive-cleanup-command"/> 完成。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ArchiveCommand</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待 <xref linkend="guc-archive-command"/> 完成。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>BackendTermination</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待另一个后端终止。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>BackupWaitWalArchive</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待备份所需的 WAL 文件成功归档。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>BgworkerShutdown</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待后台工作进程关闭。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>BgworkerStartup</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待后台工作进程启动。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>BtreePage</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待继续并行 B-tree 扫描所需的页号变为可用。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>BufferIo</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待缓冲区 I/O 完成。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>CheckpointDelayComplete</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待阻塞检查点完成的后端进程。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>CheckpointDelayStart</literal></entry>
      <entry>正在等待一个阻塞检查点启动的后端。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>CheckpointDone</literal></entry>
      <entry>正在等待检查点完成。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>CheckpointStart</literal></entry>
      <entry>正在等待检查点启动。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ExecuteGather</literal></entry>
      <entry>在执行 <literal>Gather</literal> 计划节点时，正在等待子进程的活动。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>HashBatchAllocate</literal></entry>
      <entry>正在等待被选出的 Parallel Hash 参与者分配哈希表。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>HashBatchElect</literal></entry>
      <entry>正在等待选出一个 Parallel Hash 参与者来分配哈希表。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>HashBatchLoad</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待其他 Parallel Hash 参与者完成哈希表加载。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>HashBuildAllocate</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待选出的 Parallel Hash 参与者分配初始哈希表。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>HashBuildElect</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待选举出一个 Parallel Hash 参与者来分配初始哈希表。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>HashBuildHashInner</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待其他 Parallel Hash 参与者完成对内关系的哈希计算。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>HashBuildHashOuter</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待其他 Parallel Hash 参与者完成对外关系的分区。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>HashGrowBatchesDecide</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待选举出一个 Parallel Hash 参与者来决定后续批次的增长。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>HashGrowBatchesElect</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待选出一个 Parallel Hash 参与者来分配更多批次。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>HashGrowBatchesFinish</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待选出的 Parallel Hash 参与者决定未来的批次增长。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>HashGrowBatchesReallocate</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待选出的 Parallel Hash 参与者分配更多批次。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>HashGrowBatchesRepartition</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待其他 Parallel Hash 参与者完成重新分区。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>HashGrowBucketsElect</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待选出一个 Parallel Hash 参与者来分配更多桶。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>HashGrowBucketsReallocate</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待选出的 Parallel Hash 参与者完成分配更多桶。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>HashGrowBucketsReinsert</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待其他 Parallel Hash 参与者完成将元组插入新桶。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>LogicalApplySendData</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待逻辑复制领导者应用进程向并行应用进程发送数据。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>LogicalParallelApplyStateChange</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待逻辑复制并行应用进程改变状态。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>LogicalSyncData</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待逻辑复制远程服务器发送初始表同步所需的数据。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>LogicalSyncStateChange</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待逻辑复制远程服务器改变状态。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>MessageQueueInternal</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待另一个进程连接到共享消息队列。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>MessageQueuePutMessage</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待将协议消息写入共享消息队列。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>MessageQueueReceive</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待从共享消息队列接收字节。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>MessageQueueSend</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待向共享消息队列发送字节。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>MultixactCreation</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待多事务创建完成。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ParallelBitmapScan</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待并行位图扫描完成初始化。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ParallelCreateIndexScan</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待并行 <command>CREATE INDEX</command> 工作进程完成堆扫描。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ParallelFinish</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待并行工作者完成计算。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ProcarrayGroupUpdate</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待组领导者在事务结束时清除事务 ID。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ProcSignalBarrier</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待屏障事件被所有后端处理。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>Promote</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待备库提升。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>RecoveryConflictSnapshot</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待解决 vacuum 清理的恢复冲突。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>RecoveryConflictTablespace</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待解决删除表空间的恢复冲突。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>RecoveryEndCommand</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待 <xref linkend="guc-recovery-end-command"/> 完成。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>RecoveryPause</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待恢复继续。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ReplicationOriginDrop</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待复制源变为非活动状态以便将其删除。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ReplicationSlotDrop</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待复制槽变为非活动状态以便将其删除。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>RestoreCommand</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待 <xref linkend="guc-restore-command"/> 完成。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>SafeSnapshot</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待为 <literal>READ ONLY DEFERRABLE</literal> 事务获取有效快照。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>SyncRep</literal></entry>
      <entry>在同步复制期间等待来自远程服务器的确认。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>WalReceiverExit</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待 WAL 接收器退出。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>WalReceiverUpstreamCatchup</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待上游服务器的 WAL 刷写位置赶上所请求的起始点。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>WalReceiverWaitStart</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待启动进程发送用于流复制的初始数据。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>WalSummaryReady</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待生成新的 WAL 摘要。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>XactGroupUpdate</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待组领导者在事务结束时更新事务状态。</entry>
     </row>
    </tbody>
   </tgroup>
  </table>

  <table id="wait-event-lock-table">
   <title><literal>Lock</literal> 类型的等待事件</title>
   <tgroup cols="2">
    <thead>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>Lock</literal> 等待事件</entry>
      <entry>描述</entry>
     </row>
    </thead>

    <tbody>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>advisory</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待获取咨询用户锁。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>applytransaction</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待获取逻辑复制订阅者正在应用的远程事务上的锁。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>extend</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待扩展关系。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>frozenid</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待更新 <structname>pg_database</structname>.<structfield>datfrozenxid</structfield> 和 <structname>pg_database</structname>.<structfield>datminmxid</structfield>。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>object</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待获取非关系数据库对象上的锁。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>page</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待获取关系页面上锁。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>relation</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待获取关系上的锁。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>spectoken</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待获取推测性插入锁。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>transactionid</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待事务完成。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>tuple</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待获取元组上的锁。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>userlock</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待获取用户锁。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>virtualxid</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待获取虚拟事务 ID 锁；参见 <xref linkend="transaction-id"/>。</entry>
     </row>
    </tbody>
   </tgroup>
  </table>

  <table id="wait-event-lwlock-table">
   <title><literal>Lwlock</literal> 类型的等待事件</title>
   <tgroup cols="2">
    <thead>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>LWLock</literal> 等待事件</entry>
      <entry>描述</entry>
     </row>
    </thead>

    <tbody>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>AddinShmemInit</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待管理扩展在共享内存中的空间分配。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>AioUringCompletion</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待另一个进程通过 io_uring 完成 IO。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>AioWorkerSubmissionQueue</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问 AIO 工作进程提交队列。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>AutoFile</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待更新 <filename>postgresql.auto.conf</filename> 文件。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>Autovacuum</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新自动清理工作进程的当前状态。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>AutovacuumSchedule</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待确认被选中进行自动清理的表仍然需要清理。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>BackgroundWorker</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新后台工作进程状态。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>BtreeVacuum</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新 B-tree 索引中与 vacuum 相关的信息。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>BufferContent</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问内存中的数据页。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>BufferMapping</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待将数据块与缓冲池中的缓冲区关联。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>CheckpointerComm</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待管理 fsync 请求。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>CommitTs</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新为事务提交时间戳设置的最后一个值。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>CommitTsBuffer</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待提交时间戳 SLRU 缓冲区上的 I/O。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>CommitTsSLRU</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问提交时间戳 SLRU 缓存。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ControlFile</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新 <filename>pg_control</filename> 文件或创建新的 WAL 文件。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>DSMRegistry</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新动态共享内存注册表。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>DSMRegistryDSA</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问动态共享内存注册表的动态共享内存分配器。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>DSMRegistryHash</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问动态共享内存注册表的共享哈希表。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>DynamicSharedMemoryControl</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新动态共享内存分配信息。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>InjectionPoint</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新与注入点相关的信息。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>LockFastPath</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新进程的快速路径锁信息。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>LockManager</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新关于<quote>重量级</quote>锁的信息。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>LogicalRepLauncherDSA</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问逻辑复制启动器的动态共享内存分配器。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>LogicalRepLauncherHash</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问逻辑复制启动器的共享哈希表。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>LogicalRepWorker</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新逻辑复制工作进程的状态。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>MultiXactGen</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新共享 multixact 状态。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>MultiXactMemberBuffer</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待 multixact member SLRU 缓冲区上的 I/O。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>MultiXactMemberSLRU</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问 multixact member SLRU 缓存。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>MultiXactOffsetBuffer</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待 multixact offset SLRU 缓冲区上的 I/O。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>MultiXactOffsetSLRU</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问 multixact offset SLRU 缓存。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>MultiXactTruncation</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或截断 multixact 信息。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>NotifyBuffer</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待 <command>NOTIFY</command> 消息 SLRU 缓冲区上的 I/O。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>NotifyQueue</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新 <command>NOTIFY</command> 消息。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>NotifyQueueTail</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待更新 <command>NOTIFY</command> 消息存储的限制。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>NotifySLRU</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问 <command>NOTIFY</command> 消息 SLRU 缓存。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>OidGen</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待分配新的 OID。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ParallelAppend</literal></entry>
      <entry>在 Parallel Append 计划执行期间等待选择下一个子计划。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ParallelBtreeScan</literal></entry>
      <entry>在并行 B-tree 扫描计划执行期间等待同步工作者。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ParallelHashJoin</literal></entry>
      <entry>在 Parallel Hash Join 计划执行期间等待同步工作者。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ParallelQueryDSA</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待并行查询动态共享内存分配。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ParallelVacuumDSA</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待并行 vacuum 动态共享内存分配。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>PerSessionDSA</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待并行查询动态共享内存分配。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>PerSessionRecordType</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问并行查询关于复合类型的信息。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>PerSessionRecordTypmod</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问并行查询关于标识匿名记录类型的类型修饰符的信息。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>PerXactPredicateList</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问并行查询期间当前可串行化事务持有的谓词锁列表。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>PgStatsData</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待共享内存统计数据的访问。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>PgStatsDSA</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待统计动态共享内存分配器的访问。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>PgStatsHash</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待统计共享内存哈希表的访问。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>PredicateLockManager</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问可串行化事务使用的谓词锁信息。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ProcArray</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问共享的每进程数据结构（通常是为了获取快照或报告会话的事务 ID）。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>RelationMapping</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新 <filename>pg_filenode.map</filename> 文件（用于跟踪某些系统目录的文件节点分配）。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>RelCacheInit</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新 <filename>pg_internal.init</filename> 关系缓存初始化文件。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ReplicationOrigin</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待创建、删除或使用复制源。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ReplicationOriginState</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新一个复制源的进度。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ReplicationSlotAllocation</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待分配或释放复制槽。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ReplicationSlotControl</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新复制槽状态。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ReplicationSlotIO</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待复制槽上的 I/O。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>SerialBuffer</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待可序列化事务冲突 SLRU 缓冲区上的 I/O。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>SerialControl</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新共享 <filename>pg_serial</filename> 状态。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>SerializableFinishedList</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问已完成的可序列化事务列表。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>SerializablePredicateList</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问可串行化事务持有的谓词锁列表。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>SerializableXactHash</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新有关可串行化事务的信息。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>SerialSLRU</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问可串行化事务冲突 SLRU 缓存。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>SharedTidBitmap</literal></entry>
      <entry>在并行位图索引扫描期间等待访问共享 TID 位图。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>SharedTupleStore</literal></entry>
      <entry>在并行查询期间等待访问共享元组存储。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>ShmemIndex</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待在共享内存中查找或分配空间。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>SInvalRead</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待从共享系统目录失效队列中取回消息。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>SInvalWrite</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待向共享系统目录失效队列中添加消息。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>SubtransBuffer</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待子事务 SLRU 缓冲区上的 I/O。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>SubtransSLRU</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问子事务 SLRU 缓存。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>SyncRep</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新有关同步复制状态的信息。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>SyncScan</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待选择同步表扫描的起始位置。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>TablespaceCreate</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待创建或删除表空间。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>TwoPhaseState</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新预备事务的状态。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>WaitEventCustom</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新自定义等待事件信息。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>WALBufMapping</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待替换 WAL 缓冲区中的页面。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>WALInsert</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待将 WAL 数据插入内存缓冲区。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>WALSummarizer</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待读取或更新 WAL 摘要状态。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>WALWrite</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待 WAL 缓冲区被写入磁盘。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>WrapLimitsVacuum</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待更新事务 ID 与多事务消耗的限制。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>XactBuffer</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待事务状态 SLRU 缓冲区上的 I/O。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>XactSLRU</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待访问事务状态 SLRU 缓存。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>XactTruncation</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待执行 <function>pg_xact_status</function> 或更新其可用的最旧事务 ID。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>XidGen</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待分配新的事务 ID。</entry>
     </row>
    </tbody>
   </tgroup>
  </table>

  <table id="wait-event-timeout-table">
   <title><literal>Timeout</literal> 类型的等待事件</title>
   <tgroup cols="2">
    <thead>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>Timeout</literal> 等待事件</entry>
      <entry>描述</entry>
     </row>
    </thead>

    <tbody>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>BaseBackupThrottle</literal></entry>
      <entry>在基础备份期间限制活动速率时等待。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>CheckpointWriteDelay</literal></entry>
      <entry>执行检查点时在两次写入之间等待。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>PgSleep</literal></entry>
      <entry>由于调用 <function>pg_sleep</function> 或同类函数而等待。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>RecoveryApplyDelay</literal></entry>
      <entry>由于延迟设置，在恢复期间等待应用 WAL。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>RecoveryRetrieveRetryInterval</literal></entry>
      <entry>在恢复期间，当无法从任何来源（<filename>pg_wal</filename>、归档或流）获得 WAL 数据时等待。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>RegisterSyncRequest</literal></entry>
      <entry>在向检查点进程发送同步请求时等待，因为请求队列已满。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>SpinDelay</literal></entry>
      <entry>在获取存在争用的自旋锁时等待。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>VacuumDelay</literal></entry>
      <entry>在基于成本的清理延迟点等待。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>VacuumTruncate</literal></entry>
      <entry>等待获取排他锁，以截断已清理表末尾的任何空页。</entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry><literal>WalSummarizerError</literal></entry>
      <entry>在 WAL 摘要器出错后等待。</entry>
     </row>
    </tbody>
   </tgroup>
  </table>

